            `Last 90 days: ${gscTotals.impressions.toLocaleString()} impressions · ${gscTotals.clicks.toLocaleString()} clicks · ${gscTotals.ctr}% CTR · avg position ${gscTotals.position}. ${gscMonths} months archived.`,
            `近 90 天：${gscTotals.impressions.toLocaleString()} 次展示 · ${gscTotals.clicks.toLocaleString()} 次点击 · 点击率 ${gscTotals.ctr}% · 平均排名 ${gscTotals.position}。已归档 ${gscMonths} 个月。`,
          )}</p>
          <div class="ai-grid">
